    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It chases people and Pokémon from its territory by\ncausing them to experience deep,\nnightmarish slumbers.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "深い　眠りに　誘う　力で\n人や　ポケモンに　悪夢を　見せて\n自分の　縄張りから　追い出す。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Defiende su territorio de personas y Pokémon\nhaciéndoles dormir y provocándoles pesadillas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ひとびとを　ふかい　ねむりに　さそい\nゆめを　みせる　のうりょくを　もつ。\nしんげつの　よるに　かつどうする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "사람들을 깊은 잠으로 끌어들여\n꿈을 꾸게 하는 능력을 가지고 있다.\n그믐달이 뜨는 밤에 활동한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il a la capacité de bercer les gens pour les faire rêver.\nIl se montre durant les nuits de nouvelle lune.",
